      "prompt": "Toulouse-Lautrec painted her in Paris in 1893 as swirling colour: the cloth, not the body.",
      "image_brief": "Toulouse-Lautrec's sketch of Loïe Fuller at the Folies-Bergère: the body disappears into cloth.",
      "notes": "- Extension: the costume becomes the image.\n- Who gets the credit: dancer, maker, or the person who filed the patent?"
    },
