      "asset_id": "wikimedia:File:Loie Fuller dancing with scarf.jpg",
      "heading": "4 · Many films called “Loïe Fuller” show someone else",
      "sentence": "Fuller's serpentine dance was copied everywhere, so early films sold under her name often show other dancers. Every old film is evidence to check.",
