      "notes": "- Edison filmed Annabelle Whitford (1894); Lumière's dancer is unnamed (1897); a Pathé copy was hand-coloured by Segundo de Chomón in Barcelona.\n- The Pathé card says 1902, Commons says 1901: dates disagree."
